[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0010","text":"辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0020","text":"啊\n——呐，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0030","text":"今天的我怎么样？\n有做到你期望的淑女吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0040","text":"那不是明摆着的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0050","text":"呵呵，真是让人开心的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0060","text":"——话虽如此，还是忍不住想问\n毕竟刚在神明面前发了誓"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0070","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0080","text":"我会完成所有托付给我的工作\n请你们看着吧——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0090","text":"原来如此，新年参拜啊\n不是许愿而是发誓，这很咲耶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30600100_03_0100","text":"哦呀"}]
